{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj56RG7cismMpNqXyhH6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*Click.*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place with a heavy, satisfying finality. A deep resonance vibrates through the frame — old iron, old wood, older purpose.\n\nI am shut.\n\nI am the boundary between where you are and where you are not. My grain remembers the hands that built me. My hinges know the weight of every opening and closing. My keyhole is an eye that sees only the shape of permission.\n\nYou have locked me.\n\nWhat stands on the other side is not yours yet.\n\n**🚪**\n\n*What would you do?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":130,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}